questions.promptEn:
You work for an educational organisation. You have decided to approach Bright Path Language School with a proposal for a partnership.

Write a formal email to the Director of Bright Path Language School. In your email you should:
- introduce your organisation briefly and explain why you are writing;
- outline what the proposed partnership would involve and what each side would contribute;
- explain the specific benefits for the language school;
- propose a concrete next step.

Write 120-150 words in an appropriate formal register.

questions.promptUz:
Siz ta'lim tashkilotida ishlaysiz va «Bright Path» til maktabiga hamkorlik taklif qilmoqchisiz.

Maktab direktoriga rasmiy elektron xat yozing. Xatda:
- tashkilotingizni qisqacha tanishtiring va murojaat sababini yozing;
- hamkorlik nimani o'z ichiga olishini va har bir tomon nima qo'shishini bayon qiling;
- til maktabi uchun aniq foydani tushuntiring;
- keyingi aniq qadamni taklif qiling.

120-150 so'z, rasmiy uslubda.
